+From e3e6e84a4c29ffb658003e8fe26aefd4c9b5bd00 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Abraham van der Merwe <abz@frogfoot.com>
+Date: Sun, 26 Apr 2026 16:34:50 +0200
+Subject: [PATCH 4/8] Items 3-5,7-11: scalar-wrapper batch (MakeValid,
+ ConcaveHull, PrecOverlays, WKB flavor, hull/metric/distance/linear/utility
+ extras)
+
+36 new methods, 4 new standalone PHP functions, 4 modified methods,
+6 new module constants. 8 new .phpt files (78 sub-tests).
+
+Item 3 - MakeValid family
+  GEOSGeometry::makeValid($params = [])  with 'method' linework|structure
+                                            and 'keep_collapsed' bool
+  Constants: GEOS_MAKE_VALID_LINEWORK, GEOS_MAKE_VALID_STRUCTURE
+
+Item 4 - Concave hull family
+  GEOSGeometry::concaveHull($ratio, $allowHoles = false)
+  GEOSGeometry::concaveHullByLength($maxLength, $allowHoles = false)
+  GEOSGeometry::concaveHullOfPolygons($ratio, $isTight = true, $allowHoles = false)
+  GEOSGeometry::polygonHullSimplify($isOuter, $param, ?$mode = null)
+  Constants: GEOS_HULL_PARAM_VERTEX_NUM_FRACTION,
+             GEOS_HULL_PARAM_AREA_DELTA_RATIO
+
+Item 5 - Precision-grid overlays (extend existing methods, BC-safe)
+  intersection($other, ?$gridSize = null)
+  difference($other, ?$gridSize = null)
+  symDifference($other, ?$gridSize = null)
+  union(?$other = null, ?$gridSize = null)
+
+Item 7 - WKB flavor + reader fix-structure
+  GEOSWKBWriter::setFlavor($flavor), getFlavor()
+  GEOSWKTReader::setFixStructure($fix)
+  GEOSWKBReader::setFixStructure($fix)
+  Constants: GEOSWKB_EXTENDED (default), GEOSWKB_ISO
+
+Item 8 - Hull / metric extras
+  minimumBoundingCircle, minimumRotatedRectangle, minimumWidth,
+  minimumClearance, minimumClearanceLine, maximumInscribedCircle($tol),
+  largestEmptyCircle($tol, ?$boundary)
+
+Item 9 - Distance / metric extras
+  distanceWithin, distanceIndexed, nearestPoints (returns GEOSCoordSeq),
+  frechetDistance, frechetDistanceDensify, hausdorffDistanceDensify
+
+Item 10 - Linear referencing extras
+  lineSubstring, lineMergeDirected
+
+Item 11 - Construction / utility extras
+  reverse, densify, removeRepeatedPoints, orientPolygons,
+  equalsIdentical, getXMin, getXMax, getYMin, getYMax, getExtent,
+  buildArea
+  Standalone: GEOSPolygonizeValid, GEOSPolygonizeCutEdges,
+              GEOSBuildArea, GEOSDisjointSubsetUnion
+
+15/15 .phpt tests pass.
